// The §6.3 web-demo system — the home system's Terrin slice. The demo
// is Terrin only: Rask and Duva are not in this set, so no
// interplanetary body is reachable and the demo's data-set hash can
// never match the desktop's (saves are not portable — §1.1/§6.3).
//
// `bodies` is the manifest: each entry names a `<id>/body.ron` file in
// this directory. `star` is the root every other body's parent chain
// must reach.
(
    schema_version: 1,
    id: "home",
    star: "solen",
    bodies: ["solen", "terrin"],
    epoch_note: "system.home.epoch_note",
)
